{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24879","headline":"赋得直如朱丝弦 · 杨衡","name":"赋得直如朱丝弦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞瑶琴上，深知直者情。\n幸传朱鹭曲，那止素丝名。\n瑞草人空仰，王言世久行。\n大方闻正位，乐府动清声。\n文武音初合，宫商调屡更。\n谁能向机杼，终日泣无成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}